    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a new MSA for a raw material supplier we're looking at for our Munich plant. Can you give me a checklist of standard terms and conditions we should definitely include to protect us against sudden price hikes or supply chain disruptions?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
